  "job_B14.22_20251003_114306": {
    "text": "\u00d0is syndon \u00fea laga, \u00fee \u00e6\u00f0elred cyng & his witan ger\u00e6dd habba\u00f0 \u00e6t Wanetingc to fri\u00f0es bote.\n\u00d0\u00e6t is: \u00fe\u00e6t his gri\u00f0 stande swa for\u00f0, swa hit fyrmest stod on his yldrena dagum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t sy botleas, \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00fe\u00e6t gri\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se ealdormann & kinges gerefa on Fif burga ge\u00feinc\u00f0a sylle, bete man \u00fe\u00e6t mid XII\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t gri\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man sylle\u00f0 on I burhga\u00fein\u00f0e, bete man \u00fe\u00e6t mid VI hundrum; and \u00fe\u00e6r man sylle on\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t man cy\u00f0e mid gewitnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man \u00fe\u00e6t ne awende \u00e6t cwicon \u00fee ma \u00fee \u00e6t deadon.\n& gange \u00e6lc man \u00fe\u00e6s to gewitnesse, \u00fee he durre on \u00feam haligdome swerian, \u00fee him man on hand syl\u00f0.\nAnd landcop & hlafordes gifu, \u00fee he on riht age to gifanne, & lahcop & witword & gewitnes, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00fe\u00e6t man habbe gemot on \u00e6lcum w\u00e6penkace; & gan ut \u00fea yldestan XII \u00feegnas & se gerefa mid, &\n& niman \u00feonne \u00fea tihtbysian men, \u00fee mid \u00feam gerefan habba\u00f0, & heora \u00e6lc sylle VI healfmarc wedd,\n& \u00e6lc bicge him lage mid XII oran, healf landrican, healf w\u00e6pentake.\n& \u00e6lc tihtbysig man gange to \u00feryfeldan ordale o\u00f0\u00f0e gilde feowergilde.\nGif se hlaford \u00feonne hine ladian wylle mid twam godum \u00feegenum, \u00fe\u00e6t he n\u00e6fre \u00feeofgild ne gulde,\nGif he \u00feonne ful beo, slea man hine, \u00fe\u00e6t him forberste se sweora; & gif he \u00fe\u00e6t ordal forbuge, gilde\nAnd gif se agena frigia nelle \u00fe\u00e6t ordal gesecean, gilde XX oran, & sy his sp\u00e6ce forloren; & he \u00feeah\nAnd gif hwa borhleas orf habbe & landrican hit befon, agife \u00fe\u00e6t orf & gilde XX oran.\n& \u00e6lc tiond age geweald, swa hw\u00e6\u00f0er he wille swa w\u00e6ter swa isen.\n& \u00e6lc team & \u00e6lc ordal beo on \u00fe\u00e6s kyninges byrig.\n& gif he \u00fe\u00e6t ordal forfleo, gilde se borh hine be his were.\nAnd gif hwa \u00feeof cl\u00e6nsian wylle, lecge an C to wedde, healf landrican & healf cinges gerefan binnan\nGif he cl\u00e6ne beo \u00e6t \u00feam ordale, nime upp his m\u00e6g; gif he \u00feonne ful beo, licge \u00fear he l\u00e6g, & gilde an\nAnd \u00e6lc mynetere, \u00fee man tih\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t fals feoh sloge, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hit forboden w\u00e6s, gange to \u00ferimfealdan\nAnd nan mann ne age n\u00e6nne mynetere buton cyng.\n& \u00e6lc mynetere \u00fee betihtlad si, bicge him lah mid XII oran.\n& nan mann hry\u00f0er ne slea, buton he habbe twegra trywra manna gewitnesse, & he healde III niht hyde\n& gif he \u00fea hyde \u00e6r \u00feam aweg sylle, gilde XX oran.\n& \u00e6lc flyma beo flyma on \u00e6lcum lande, \u00fee on anum sy.\n& nan man nage nane socne ofer cynges \u00feegen buton cyng sylf.\nAnd \u00e6t cynges sp\u00e6ce lecge man VI healfmarc wedd & \u00e6t eorles & biscopes XII oran wedd & \u00e6t\n& gif man hwilcne man teo, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone man fede, \u00fee ures hlafordes gri\u00f0 tobrocen habbe, ladige hine\nAnd gif hine man mid him befare, beon hig begen anes rihtes weor\u00f0e.\n& \u00fe\u00e6t dom stande, \u00fear \u00feegenas samm\u00e6le beon; gif hig sacan, stande \u00fe\u00e6t hig VIII secga\u00f0; & \u00fea \u00fee\n& \u00fear \u00feegen age twegen costas, lufe o\u00f0\u00f0e lage, & he \u00feonne lufe geceose, stande \u00fe\u00e6t swa f\u00e6st swa se\n& se \u00f0e ofer \u00f0\u00e6t lade ge\u00feafie o\u00f0\u00f0e se \u00fee hy sylle, gilde VI healfmarc.\nAnd se \u00fee sitte uncwydd & uncrafod on his are on life, \u00fe\u00e6t nan mann on his yrfenuman ne spece \u00e6fter\nAnd se \u00fee reafa\u00f0 man leohtan d\u00e6ge, & he hit ky\u00fee to \u00ferim tunan, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne beo nanes fry\u00f0es weor\u00f0e.\n& \u00fea myneteras \u00fee inne wuda wyrce\u00f0 